  "description": "There's a stalker next door and a crazy person living upstairs! \n\nArt student Kim Haru runs away from the goshiwon with terrible memories to a shabby one-room apartment. A month after moving in, a suicide occurs next door and a gloomy and suspicious woman moves in. Then one day, when Kim Haru returns home, he encounters the woman next door standing in his room with a kitchen knife...\n\n*\"Haru... I can do anything for you.\"* \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Includesone extra chapter.*",
